# rena0-melee-ground-300 — F1-3 fixture
# Expectations cite the recovered ground melee entry: a fresh ground AttackA press admits
# row 300 (FUN_00445ee0's input selector through the admission dispatcher;
# tests/melee_admission_test.cpp and tests/rena_animation_audit_test.cpp:242-297 pin the
# same row for Rena+0).
#
# Measured anchors on this build: the swing starts on the press update with its row-300
# clip and a swing_started edge, FighterState::AttackA is enum value 3, and the swing's
# combat window does not open until update 25 (updates 2-24 are not active) — a late active
# window is recorded here as this build's timing, not as a recovered tick number.
combo 0 0
seed 5489
spawn 0 0 0 0
spawn 1 0 0 2000
collision open-field
input 0 MELEE
input 1 -
expect 0 attack_row 300
expect 0 anim_row 300
expect 0 state_enum 3
expect 0 swing_started 1
expect 25 melee_active 1
expect 30 dummy_static 1
